{"id":9295,"date":"2021-10-06T12:03:49","date_gmt":"2021-10-06T12:03:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/solutions\/security-forces\/analysis-of-inks-using-imaging-ft-ir-atr\/"},"modified":"2021-10-06T12:04:36","modified_gmt":"2021-10-06T12:04:36","slug":"analysis-of-inks-using-imaging-ft-ir-atr","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/solutions\/security-forces\/analysis-of-inks-using-imaging-ft-ir-atr\/","title":{"rendered":"Analysis of inks using imaging FT-IR ATR"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"9295\" class=\"elementor elementor-9295 elementor-9275\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c7f8e63 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c7f8e63\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7377343\" data-id=\"7377343\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e08c0f0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-eael-adv-tabs\" data-id=\"e08c0f0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"eael-adv-tabs.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t        <div data-scroll-on-click=\"no\" data-scroll-speed=\"300\" id=\"eael-advance-tabs-e08c0f0\" class=\"eael-advance-tabs eael-tabs-horizontal eael-tab-auto-active  active-caret-on responsive-vertical-layout\" data-tabid=\"e08c0f0\">\n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-nav\">\n                <ul class=\"\" role=\"tablist\">\n                                            <li id=\"application-description\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"application-description-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Application description<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >FT-IR spectroscopy<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"application-description-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"application-description-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_9278\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9278\" style=\"width: 250px\" class=\"wp-caption alignleft\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9278\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/cf9733c4-237x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"316\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/cf9733c4-237x300.jpg 237w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/cf9733c4-809x1024.jpg 809w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/cf9733c4-768x972.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/cf9733c4.jpg 840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9278\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.piketech.com\/product\/atr-gladiatr-tm-vision\/\">GladiATR sampling accessories<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p><strong><span style=\"{wpml_trans_unit_2_0_2_0_0_-1_0}\">Fast analysis of inks on paper using thesampling accessory<\/span> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.piketech.com\/product\/atr-gladiatr-tm-vision\/\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">GladiATR Vision sampling accessory<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Thanks to the simplicity of sampling, the <strong>FT-IR ATR<\/strong> technique has gained a large number of fans. Using a single interface &#8211; the ATR crystal &#8211; it is possible to measure a wide range of samples: <strong>liquids, solids, pastes, gels and powders<\/strong>. However, sometimes it is important to determine where the spectrum will be measured, whether it is because you are interested in how homogeneous the sample is, or because it is a more complex sample such as paper ink, fiber sample or contamination.<\/p>\n<p>And that is why the GladiATR Vision ATR sampling accessory, compatible with Nicolet FT-IR spectrometers, was developed: with it is possible to display the analyzed part of the sample. You can select a specific point that interests you, which expands the possibilities of the ATR technique, for example in forensic studies.<\/p>\n<p>Its use can be demonstrated on the example of the analysis of inks on paper. The paper itself has a very strong spectrum in both FT-IR and Raman spectroscopy, where it often has fluorescence, which makes measurement significantly difficult. However, fluorescence cannot, by its nature, occur in the infrared spectra; in addition, it is a <strong>fast, reliable and non-destructive<\/strong> method of analysis, so that the samples can then be used, e.g. during the evidentiary processes.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_9276\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9276\" style=\"width: 623px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9276 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-623x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"623\" height=\"1024\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-623x1024.png 623w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-183x300.png 183w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-768x1262.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-934x1536.png 934w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e-1246x2048.png 1246w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/10\/74d8d34e.png 1367w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 623px) 100vw, 623px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9276\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Spectra of three different inks on white paper measured using GladiATR Vision (red spectra of paper, blue spectra of inks with marked characteristic bands)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>It can be seen that the spectrum of the paper is really very intense. Even so, it was possible to identify the spectral characteristic of each of the black inks in the ink spectra and compare them with each other: they are clearly distinguishable from each other.<\/p>\n                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ft-ir-spectroscopy-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-6756 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-6756 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"6756\" class=\"elementor elementor-6756 elementor-5032\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-66c51c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor